---
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { RETURN_DAYS } from '../lib/merchantReturnPolicy';
---

<Layout
  title="Return Policy | FHB — Father's Heart Bible™"
  description={`Return policy for Father's Heart Bible™ print Bibles and eBooks bought direct: ${RETURN_DAYS} days from delivery, full refund to your original payment method, no need to ship the book back.`}
  jsonLd={{
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://fathersheartbible.com/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Return Policy", "item": "https://fathersheartbible.com/returns/" }
    ]
  }}
>

  <main id="main-content" style="margin-top: 80px;">
    <Section variant="soft">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light mb-8" style="font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--color-ink);">Return Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm mb-8" style="color: var(--color-muted); font-family: var(--font-sans);">Last updated: November 8, 2026</p>

        <div class="space-y-8" style="font-family: var(--font-sans); color: var(--color-muted);">

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--color-ink);">Our Promise</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">If a Father's Heart Bible™ you bought directly from fathersheartbible.com is not right for you, tell us within <strong>{RETURN_DAYS} days of delivery</strong> and we will make it right. What happens next depends on the reason, as described below.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--color-ink);">Damaged, Misprinted or Lost</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">If your copy arrives damaged, has a printing or binding defect, or is lost in transit, we will send a free replacement or refund you in full, whichever you prefer. You do not send the book back: keep it or destroy it. For a damaged or misprinted copy, please send a photo of the problem. For a lost parcel, we use the carrier's tracking.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--color-ink);">Change of Mind</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">Changed your mind? Send the book back unread within {RETURN_DAYS} days of delivery, at your own cost to return it, and we will refund the full price of the book to your original payment method as soon as it arrives.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--color-ink);">eBooks</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">If an eBook file cannot be opened, ask within {RETURN_DAYS} days of purchase and we will refund it in full.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--color-ink);">Order Number Required</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">Refunds are made only against an order placed on fathersheartbible.com. Please have your order number ready, as it is in your confirmation email.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--color-ink);">Fair Use of This Policy</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">We offer one no-return refund per customer. We may decline repeat claims, so that we can keep this policy generous for everyone.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--color-ink);">How to Ask for a Refund</h2>
            <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 leading-relaxed">
              <li>Email <strong>hello@spiritmediapublishing.com</strong> with your order number and the edition you ordered.</li>
              <li>Tell us the reason: damaged, misprinted or lost, or change of mind. For damaged or misprinted copies, attach a photo. Choose a refund or, for those cases, a replacement.</li>
              <li>We confirm by email and, for a change of mind, tell you where to send the book. Refunds go back to your original payment method; your bank typically posts them within 5 to 10 business days.</li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--color-ink);">What This Covers</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">This policy covers print Bibles and eBooks bought directly from fathersheartbible.com and shipped within the United States. Copies bought elsewhere follow the seller's return policy. Donations are described in our <a href="/terms/" style="color: var(--color-brand); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">Terms of Use</a>.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--color-ink);">Contact</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">Questions? Email <strong>hello@spiritmediapublishing.com</strong> or write to:</p>
            <p class="leading-relaxed mt-2">Spirit Media Publishing<br/>205 Academy Street #3251<br/>Cary, NC 27519<br/>United States</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </Section>
  </main>

</Layout>
